<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net6.0;net8.0;net9.0;net10.0;net11.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>

    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CS1591</NoWarn>

    <PackageId>TechTeaStudio.Protocols.Hyperion</PackageId>
    <Version>0.5.0</Version>
    <Authors>Ronald Ryan</Authors>
    <Company>Tech Tea Studio</Company>
    <Description>High-performance chunked TCP messaging protocol for .NET. Pluggable serialization, adaptive lightweight/direct/chunked modes, and async/await with cancellation.</Description>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/TechTeaStudio/HyperionProtocol</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/TechTeaStudio/HyperionProtocol</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageIcon>icon2.png</PackageIcon>

    <Copyright>Copyright © Tech Tea Studio 2026</Copyright>

    <PackageReleaseNotes>
v0.5.0 - Opt-in per-chunk Zstandard compression of chunked frames on .NET 11: HyperionProtocolOptions.ChunkCompression (Off / Accept / Compress) and CompressionThreshold. Off by default, and with it off the wire format is byte-identical to 0.4.x on every target. Compressed messages carry protocol version 2 and need a 0.5.0 peer on .NET 11 with compression enabled; older or Off peers reject them loudly. New error codes CompressionNotSupported and DecompressionFailed.

v0.4.1 - Added the net11.0 target. No API or wire format changes.

v0.4.0 - Protocol design review: hard limits, timeouts, integrity, error codes, telemetry, streaming send, Stream/TLS support.

Added:
  * HyperionProtocolOptions.MaxMessageSize (default 1 GiB), ReceiveTimeout / SendTimeout (idle timeouts, default off) and ChunkChecksum (per-chunk CRC-32C: Off / Emit / Required).
  * HyperionErrorCode on every HyperionProtocolException (InvalidMagic, MessageTooLarge, ChecksumMismatch, Timeout, PeerClosed, ...).
  * SendStreamingAsync(Stream source, long length, Stream destination): send files of any size without buffering; pairs with ReceiveStreamingAsync.
  * ReceiveStreamingAsync(PipeReader) and a SmartHyperionProtocol override of ReceiveStreamingAsync that understands all three framings.
  * HyperionDiagnostics: System.Diagnostics.Metrics counters and ActivitySource spans (OpenTelemetry-ready).
  * Crc32C helper (SSE4.2 / ARM intrinsics with table fallback).
  * docs/DESIGN.md, docs/SPECIFICATION.md and docs/DESIGN_CHECKLIST.md.

Changed:
  * All NetworkStream parameters are now Stream, so SslStream (TLS), named pipes and in-memory streams work directly. Source-compatible for callers; subclasses overriding the old signatures must update them.
  * Receivers enforce the uniform-chunk rule (all non-final chunks carry the size of chunk 0) and MaxMessageSize, both before reading payload bytes.
  * A clean disconnect at a message boundary is reported as HyperionErrorCode.PeerClosed; a disconnect mid-frame as UnexpectedEndOfStream; ReceiveStreamingAsync now wraps EOF the same way as the buffered paths.
  * Header JSON is produced by a System.Text.Json source generator (no reflection on the hot path).

Wire format: unchanged and backward compatible with 0.1.x-0.3.x. The optional "Crc32C" header member is ignored by older receivers.

Full changelog: https://github.com/TechTeaStudio/HyperionProtocol/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md
    </PackageReleaseNotes>

    <PackageTags>network;protocol;tcp;sockets;client-server;communication;serialization;async;high-performance;lightweight;framing;chunking;streaming;pipelines;crc32c;compression;zstd;zstandard;TechTeaStudio</PackageTags>

  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE</PackageLicenseFile>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="System.IO.Pipelines" Version="8.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="TechTeaStudio.Protocols.Hyperion.Tests" />
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="TechTeaStudio.Protocols.Hyperion.Benchmarks" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\icon2.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\..\CHANGELOG.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
